[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3962.23, "timestamp": "01:06:02", "text": "冰箱里的东西都吃掉吗？我的意思是，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3965.99, "timestamp": "01:06:05", "text": "父母把它保存了一段时间，而我也有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3968.39, "timestamp": "01:06:08", "text": "你以前吃过过期芥末酱吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3971.51, "timestamp": "01:06:11", "text": "哦，是的。哦，是的。一次。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3973.99, "timestamp": "01:06:13", "text": "相同的。就像我以前吃过的芥末酱一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3976.15, "timestamp": "01:06:16", "text": "当时大概三岁，远远超过了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3977.75, "timestamp": "01:06:17", "text": "虽然已经过了保质期，但味道仍然很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3979.91, "timestamp": "01:06:19", "text": "美好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3981.99, "timestamp": "01:06:21", "text": "我当时想，这没什么大问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3983.51, "timestamp": "01:06:23", "text": "自从我……之后，它就一直放在冰箱里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3985.589, "timestamp": "01:06:25", "text": "更年轻一些。那时我还年轻。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3987.67, "timestamp": "01:06:27", "text": "那时候，但大概过了三年"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3989.51, "timestamp": "01:06:29", "text": "日期。我当时就想，这味道像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3992.95, "timestamp": "01:06:32", "text": "对我来说是芥末。我会全部用完。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3994.87, "timestamp": "01:06:34", "text": "我当时觉得这没什么不对劲。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3998.15, "timestamp": "01:06:38", "text": "它。不，不，不，不。一切都很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4000.47, "timestamp": "01:06:40", "text": "我甚至都没生病。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4005.349, "timestamp": "01:06:45", "text": "你呢？除此之外，还有什么？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4006.357, "timestamp": "01:06:46", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "eloo joqqqqqqyyyyyy"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4008.39, "timestamp": "01:06:48", "text": "你还吃过其他过期食品吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4011.71, "timestamp": "01:06:51", "text": "过期商品"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4015.43, "timestamp": "01:06:55", "text": "呃，面包之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4017.91, "timestamp": "01:06:57", "text": "等等，你是那种喜欢吃东西的人吗？"}]